From 9b718620a0efb396e6162a47f9add89505d0e5f0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sysretq0 <sysretq0@proton.me>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 05:27:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: sound/mfd/usb: Add FS1599, MT6358 ACCDET, and
 OTG properties

Add device tree bindings for the FourSemi FS1599 analog speaker amplifier
and MediaTek MT6358/MT6366 ACCDET headset jack detector, add the accdet
child node to the MT6397/MT6358 MFD schema, allow aux-devs and
mediatek,accdet on the MT6789-MT6366 sound card, and allow the optional
usb-otg-vbus regulator child on BQ25890/SC89601A and OF graph port on
MediaTek MUSB for Type-C dual-role switching.

Signed-off-by: sysretq0 <sysretq0@proton.me>
---
 .../bindings/mfd/mediatek,mt6397.yaml         |   7 ++
 .../bindings/power/supply/bq25890.yaml        |   6 +
 .../bindings/sound/foursemi,fs1599.yaml       |  43 +++++++
 .../sound/mediatek,mt6358-accdet.yaml         | 119 ++++++++++++++++++
 .../sound/mediatek,mt6789-mt6366-sound.yaml   |   8 ++
 .../bindings/usb/mediatek,musb.yaml           |   5 +-
 6 files changed, 178 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
 create mode 100644 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/foursemi,fs1599.yaml
 create mode 100644 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/mediatek,mt6358-accdet.yaml

